2026-07-27T10:00:20.6855750Z Start test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
2026-07-27T10:00:20.6898976Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T10:00:20.6899548Z i /tmp/Rtmpwkjp2R/duckdb
2026-07-27T10:00:20.6899837Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T10:00:20.6900155Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T10:00:20.6900449Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T10:00:20.6900872Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T10:00:20.6901466Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T10:00:20.6902204Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
